        <mxCell id="YJSM0Sixuiy3ghBWvyxT-38" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1. Strings is immutable. But how?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;→ when you write this code user_1 value is updated with the new value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;but the previous value (&quot;Aryan&quot;) never get deleted or updated. there is a container created in the memory with the new value (&quot;ERAZER&quot;) . and the reference (arrow) is changed from previous container to new one (see fig.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;→ Conclusion: Values never change (for immutable data types). References change. (for string - a immutable data type)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;2. Then how previous value (extra values that now not required) in the memory get remove?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;→ Garbage collector runs in a loop in python that cleans these values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="760" x="60" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YJSM0Sixuiy3ghBWvyxT-43" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#009900;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;#Assignment: Find the output&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;#python_code.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;user_1 = &quot;Aryan&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;user_2 = user_1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;user_1 = &quot;ERAZER&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;print (user_1)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; #find in mind first then execute in vs code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;print(user_2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
