        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X3Z3BbEjg0s2d3KeM9XT-59" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;For File:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;When you take reference/store of a file into a variable, that variable is an iterable object in itself (f = iter(f) = f.__next__()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;div&gt;For List:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;When you take reference/store of a list/array into a variable, that variable in NOT an iterable object.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="770" x="33.47" y="3680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
